number: XVI
name: The Star
path: m2.736 6.948 7.11-4.664-4.794 6.98m-1.384-2.6a1.667 1.667 0 1 0 0 3.335 1.667 1.667 0 1 0 0-3.335z
uprightMeaning: renewal, faith, quiet light
reversedMeaning: drought, withheld light
tags: season:spring, element:water, gem:sapphire, flower:violet
flavor: She pours and pours. The water knows where to go.

--- upright
She kneels at the water. The jar empties. The water continues. There is no end to what is poured here.
---

--- reversed
The water has stopped where she cannot see it stopping. The jar is held in the same posture. The river beneath has gone dry.
---
